{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://schemas.example.org/cd3-mws-pilot/resurvey_3yr/resurvey_3yr.schema.json",
  "title": "MWS — RESURVEY_3YR table",
  "description": "Array of Million Women Study 3-year ('yellow') resurvey records. One element is one participant's 3-year follow-up record, combining the '3-year resurvey' sheet and the 'Dietary data at 3-year resurvey' sheet (same wave, same grain).",
  "$comment": "This table has no participant-identifier field in the source dictionary at all, same as the recruitment table (open item, see DECISIONS.md D007/D047) -- uniqueItems is asserted as standing structural policy but cannot anchor to a real key here, and there is currently no way to link a resurvey_3yr row back to its recruitment row for the same participant.",
  "type": "array",
  "minItems": 1,
  "uniqueItems": true,
  "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "title": "RESURVEY_3YR record",
    "allOf": [
      {
        "$ref": "categories/demographics.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/reproductive_hormonal.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/dietary.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/behavioral.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/anthropometric.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/early_life.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/wellbeing_sleep.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/parental_mortality.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/socioeconomic.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/medications.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/family_history.json"
      },
      {
        "$ref": "categories/medical_history.json"
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Skip pattern: never used HRT means start age, duration, and type are structurally not applicable -- D052, mirrors the recruitment table's confirmed D039 pattern. Deliberately does NOT include F1HTNPC=4 ('Ever, status not known') -- steward-confirmed to stay unconstrained, D052.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1HTNPC"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1HTNPC": {
              "const": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1HRTSTA": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1HTTYPE": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1HTDUR": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1HTLU": {
              "type": "null"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Applicability: a participant who has ever used HRT (Past or Current) must have real values for start age, duration, and type -- D052.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1HTNPC"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1HTNPC": {
              "enum": [
                2,
                3
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1HRTSTA": {
              "not": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            },
            "F1HTTYPE": {
              "not": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            },
            "F1HTDUR": {
              "not": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "HRT routing: a participant currently using HRT has not stopped, so time-since-last-used is structurally not applicable -- D052.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1HTNPC"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1HTNPC": {
              "const": 3
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1HTLU": {
              "type": "null"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Applicability: a participant who stopped using HRT in the past must have a real value for time-since-last-used -- D052.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1HTNPC"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1HTNPC": {
              "const": 2
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1HTLU": {
              "not": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Skip pattern: the real questionnaire's smoking-status question is 'have you ever been a smoker?' -- a Never answer means the participant skips the cigarettes-per-day follow-up entirely, so it is structurally not applicable -- D062, corrects D060.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1SMOKE"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1SMOKE": {
              "const": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1CIGSPD": {
              "type": "null"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Applicability: a participant who has ever smoked (Past or Current) must have a real answer for cigarettes-per-day -- D062. '1=None' remains a valid real answer here, e.g. a past/current smoker who reports zero on average -- steward-confirmed this is left untouched, not remapped.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1SMOKE"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1SMOKE": {
              "enum": [
                2,
                3
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1CIGSPD": {
              "not": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Skip pattern: mother alive means age-when-died and all 7 cause-of-death fields are structurally not applicable -- D071. Deliberately does NOT include F1MALIVE=3 ('Do not know') -- steward-confirmed to stay unconstrained, D071.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1MALIVE"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1MALIVE": {
              "const": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1MDAGE": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MDHRT": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MDSTR": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MDPNU": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MDOLD": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MDCABR": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MDCAWO": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MDCAOV": {
              "type": "null"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Applicability: a participant whose mother is alive must have a real answer for mother's current age -- D071.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1MALIVE"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1MALIVE": {
              "const": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1MAGE": {
              "not": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Skip pattern: mother deceased means her current age is structurally not applicable -- D071.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1MALIVE"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1MALIVE": {
              "const": 2
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1MAGE": {
              "type": "null"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Applicability: a participant whose mother has died must have a real answer for her age at death -- D071. The 7 cause-of-death fields are deliberately NOT required nonnull here -- checkbox semantics mean most are legitimately non-1 for any given deceased mother.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1MALIVE"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1MALIVE": {
              "const": 2
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1MDAGE": {
              "not": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Skip pattern: no partner means whether the partner smokes is structurally not applicable -- D073.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1PART"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1PART": {
              "const": 2
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1PARTSM": {
              "type": "null"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Applicability: a participant who currently has a partner must have a real answer for whether that partner smokes -- D073.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1PART"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1PART": {
              "const": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1PARTSM": {
              "not": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "$comment": "Skip pattern: no medication used in the last 4 weeks means all 19 specific medication fields are structurally not applicable -- D075, same shape as parental_mortality's F1MALIVE gate (D071). No applicability rule is added in the other direction -- checkbox semantics mean most of the 19 fields are legitimately non-1 for any given participant even when F1MED=1, same reasoning as the cause-of-death block.",
        "if": {
          "required": [
            "F1MED"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "F1MED": {
              "const": 2
            }
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "properties": {
            "F1MEDTHY": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDIBU": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDASP": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDTAM": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDBEN": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDAML": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDDIG": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDPAR": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDPRO": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDATN": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDWAR": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDPRE": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDLOS": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDPRZ": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDINS": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDCOP": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDAMI": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDSLE": {
              "type": "null"
            },
            "F1MEDLIT": {
              "type": "null"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unevaluatedProperties": false
  }
}
